// include: series
// Peak (maximum) CPU per machine and interval: spikes stay visible instead of hiding behind the mean. Gaps stay null.
Samples
| where Metric == "CPU percent" and isnotnull(Value)
| lookup kind=inner (Machines | project ResourceId, Machine) on ResourceId
| make-series Peak = max(Value) default = real(null) on TimeGenerated from bin(WindowStart, BarStep) to bin(WindowEnd, BarStep) + BarStep step BarStep by Machine
